{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想同時看清楚一天花了多少錢、又用了多少時間？《DualTimeLedger》把支出、收入與時間區塊整合在同一套流程之中，讓你在同一個地方追蹤金錢與時間。它採用本機優先設計，記錄留在裝置上，無需登入即可開始使用，適合關注個人時間成本與日常開支的用家。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-145.webp\">\n<h2>雙向連結交易與時間區塊</h2>\n<p>你可以把一筆交易連結到某個時間區塊，方向不限，之後查看合併統計，瞭解每一天在金錢與時間上的實際成本。應用支援多種語言與常用貨幣，並提供淺色、深色外觀及三款內建主題，方便按環境切換。所有記錄保留在裝置本機，不用註冊帳號即可直接使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-263-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-264-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-265-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-266-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：DualTimeLedger : TimeCost Log</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.774776+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T07:22:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:17:57.374797+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:18.658693+00:00","content_hash":"94045b839516f96caa5b5493a38fa902ce5292e6a5c58f9616f46ce2e7017bf2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}